1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,359
Billy the Bear: Buddyland's mascot, and his animatronic Buddies are coming out to

2
00:00:04,359 --> 00:00:04,609
play.

3
00:00:04,829 --> 00:00:06,109
Here's how he plays.

4
00:00:06,933 --> 00:00:11,458
Before you reveal the Setup card, place four Power Source tokens, Active side up, in

5
00:00:11,458 --> 00:00:14,421
four spaces, none next to another. Set the fifth aside.

6
00:00:14,641 --> 00:00:18,863
Shuffle the A and B Bloodlust Track tokens face down by type, and place six on the

7
00:00:18,863 --> 00:00:22,261
matching spaces of his Bloodlust track. The spare two aren't used;

8
00:00:22,261 --> 00:00:23,239
don't look at them.

9
00:00:23,459 --> 00:00:27,489
Shuffle the five Buddy cards into a deck, set the two Special Buddies aside, and

10
00:00:27,489 --> 00:00:28,195
spawn a Buddy.

11
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,332
When Bloodlust rises onto a space with a Bloodlust Track token, reveal it and apply

12
00:00:33,332 --> 00:00:36,360
its effect. You won't know what's coming until it happens.

13
00:00:37,167 --> 00:00:41,327
When you see the recharge icon, Billy recovers one health, as long as at least one

14
00:00:41,327 --> 00:00:42,799
Power Source is still Active.

15
00:00:43,019 --> 00:00:47,001
To Deactivate one, spend the Time shown while in its space, even if you're just

16
00:00:47,001 --> 00:00:49,269
moving through. Flip it to the Inactive side.

17
00:00:49,489 --> 00:00:51,994
Some cards Activate them again, so check the board.

18
00:00:51,994 --> 00:00:54,204
Once they're all off, he can't heal this way.

19
00:00:55,033 --> 00:00:59,269
Buddies are Minions, and each card gives that animatronic's health, Attack Value and

20
00:00:59,269 --> 00:01:00,025
Movement Value.

21
00:01:00,245 --> 00:01:04,277
To spawn a Buddy, reveal the top card of the Buddy deck, put that many Health

22
00:01:04,277 --> 00:01:08,624
markers on it, and place its token in a space next to Billy, one without a Buddy if

23
00:01:08,624 --> 00:01:11,189
possible. If Billy isn't in play, nothing spawns.

24
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,084
Each Buddy has an Initiative number in the circle, top right.

25
00:01:15,084 --> 00:01:18,976
Resolve Minion Actions and Terror effects for Buddies from lowest to highest.

26
00:01:19,196 --> 00:01:22,058
Toby, for example, has three health and Initiative one.

27
00:01:22,058 --> 00:01:26,169
Billy Junior, a Special Buddy, has two health, Initiative six, and is always in

28
00:01:26,169 --> 00:01:26,897
Billy's space.

29
00:01:27,117 --> 00:01:31,089
When you kill a Buddy, remove its token, take the Kill Reward on its card, then

30
00:01:31,089 --> 00:01:34,306
remove the card from the game. Killed outside your Action phase?

31
00:01:34,306 --> 00:01:36,568
Take the reward at the start of the next one.

32
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:41,392
Buddies protect Billy at all costs. You can't attack Billy while there's a Buddy in

33
00:01:41,392 --> 00:01:43,075
his space, so clear them out first.

34
00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:46,417
Deathlust adds one to Billy's Movement and Attack.

35
00:01:46,637 --> 00:01:50,726
The Epic Merciless Minions adds a move before the attack in the Finale's Minion

36
00:01:50,726 --> 00:01:54,659
Action. It's the most punishing: players win under half their games with it.

37
00:01:54,879 --> 00:01:59,339
Endless Power reveals an extra Final Health token for each Active Power Source and

38
00:01:59,339 --> 00:02:03,092
keeps the best. Introducing Billy Junior spawns him in Billy's space.

39
00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:08,160
In every Finale, Buddies act first, then Billy recovers a health if a Power Source

40
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:09,511
is Active, before hunting.

41
00:02:09,731 --> 00:02:13,740
It's Showtime!: you can't play Reaction cards if more than one Enemy is in your

42
00:02:13,740 --> 00:02:16,429
space. Sizzling Power and Encore are harder versions.

43
00:02:16,649 --> 00:02:20,937
The Epic Power Surge spawns Boris, and you must kill both Billy and Boris to win.

44
00:02:21,767 --> 00:02:25,628
A few tips. Switch the Power Sources off first, routing through them as you go.

45
00:02:25,848 --> 00:02:29,669
Kill Buddies for their rewards, but don't get swarmed, and remember Billy Junior

46
00:02:29,669 --> 00:02:31,245
must go before you can hit Billy.

47
00:02:31,465 --> 00:02:34,363
Players win about sixty per cent of games against him.

48
00:02:34,363 --> 00:02:34,900
Good luck.

